.TH tucat n 0.2 tclutils
.SH tclutils::tucat
.PP
Small \fBcat\fR\-like helpers.
.CS
package require tclutils::tucat
puts [::tclutils::tucat::file README.md]
puts [::tclutils::tucat::file README.md -number 1]
.CE
.PP
Commands:
.IP \(bu
\fBtext text ?options?\fR
.IP \(bu
\fBfile path ?options?\fR
.IP \(bu
\fBfiles paths ?options?\fR
.PP
Options:
.IP \(bu
\fB\-number 1\fR number all lines
.IP \(bu
\fB\-nonblank 1\fR number only non\-empty lines
.PP
As with \fBcat \-n\fR, the end of the text after the last \fB\en\fR is not a line and gets no number, and \fBfiles\fR numbers the joined files in one run. Files are joined as they are: a file without a final \fB\en\fR runs into the next one. Unknown options raise \fBTCLUTILS COMMON OPTION \-name\fR (0.2; 0.1 numbered an empty last line, started at 1 for every file and ignored unknown options).
